// Shared build settings — committed.
//
// Signing identity is NOT committed. `DEVELOPMENT_TEAM` and the bundle-ID base
// live in `Config/Local.xcconfig`, which is gitignored, because they are
// per-developer facts: a second person is not in the first person's Apple team,
// and a bundle ID registered to one team cannot be registered by another (free
// provisioning especially). Baking them into `project.pbxproj` meant a
// collaborator had to dirty a tracked file to build at all.
//
// Copy `Config/Local.xcconfig.example` to `Config/Local.xcconfig` and fill it
// in. Simulator builds and CI need neither value, which is why the include is
// optional and the defaults below are blank/generic.

WT_DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
WT_BUNDLE_ID_BASE = com.example.workouttracker

// Last, so a developer's own values win over the defaults above.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
